        L-triomino (3 cells: (0,0)(0,1)(1,1)) -> 4
        vertical-3 (3 cells: (0,0)(1,0)(2,0)) -> 2
        S-tetromino (4 cells: (0,0)(0,1)(1,1)(1,2)) -> 8
